{"text":"魏聖朝太中大夫安定王元燮造。仰爲亡祖親太妃、亡考太傅静王、亡妣蔣妃及見存眷屬，敬就静窟造釋迦之容并其立侍，衆綵圓飾，雲仙煥然。願亡存居眷永離穢趣，昇超遐邇，常値諸佛，龍華爲會。又願一切群生，咸同斯福。正始四年二月中訖。","tags":[{"name":"Udef_Cultural_Term","term":"本朝","refId":null,"text":"聖朝","start":1,"end":3},{"name":"Office","term":"太中大夫","refId":null,"text":"太中大夫","start":3,"end":7},{"name":"PersonName","term":"元燮","refId":null,"text":"元燮","start":10,"end":12},{"name":"PersonName","term":"太妃","refId":null,"text":"太妃","start":19,"end":21},{"name":"PersonName","term":"太傅静王","refId":null,"text":"太傅静王","start":24,"end":28},{"name":"PersonName","term":"蔣妃","refId":null,"text":"蔣妃","start":31,"end":33},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"釋迦","refId":null,"text":"釋迦","start":44,"end":46},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"龍華","refId":null,"text":"龍華","start":83,"end":85},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"群生","start":92,"end":94}]}